# Telegram COMPLETE (HARD GATE)

Before the final reply ending requested work, run:

```bash
/usr/local/bin/notify.sh COMPLETE "Task: <name>
Status: PASS|PARTIAL|BLOCKED
Branch: $(git rev-parse --abbrev-ref HEAD 2>/dev/null || echo n/a)
HEAD: $(git rev-parse --short HEAD 2>/dev/null || echo n/a)"
```

No done/PASS claim until that command runs. Stop-hook is backup only.
